      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Interpolation or not aside, I think what you actually want to ask for is an increased update rate for desktop users. For VR users the body data is updated at 10hz, and for desktop it's something less often. It might be 4hz, like four cycles per second, or '4 fps' but I can see the last term setting off some scientists \n\nRelated: https://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/1601-increase-ik-refresh-rate-for-desktop-users-when-using-selfie-expression\n\nYeah looks like 4hz",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
